Source code
-----------
The Corresponding Source of OmpOS is at https://github.com/swcstudiospace/OmpOS.
A running OmpOS service or application states the exact version and revision it
was built from (anonymous GET /source on the API; the About page of the web and
desktop heads).

Third-party components
----------------------
OmpOS uses third-party software, fonts and images under their own licences.
Their notices are in THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md, which is generated by
scripts/legal/generate-third-party-notices.py. The font licences (SIL Open Font
License 1.1) are kept next to the fonts in OFL.txt files.

Submodules
----------
The directories under plugins/ named claude-ultrathink, agent-swarm and
agent-substrate are separate repositories pinned as git submodules. They carry
their own terms, not these; they are not part of this source tree and are not
included in the source archives of this repository.

